    "details": "The LibreSSL project reports:\n\n> - Ensure verify callbacks always returning 1 can see a hostname\n>   mismatch\n> - Correct botched size check in dtls1_preprocess_fragment()\n> - Limit size of buffered DTLS handshake messages\n> - Avoid potential overread on interrupted retransmission in DTLS\n> - Fix OCSP responder authorization bypass in libtls and ocspcheck(8)\n",
